<h1>Kliniske Algoritmer og Flowcharts</h1>

<p class="lead">
  Denne side indeholder visuelt guidende algoritmer for vigtige kliniske beslutninger 
  ved behandling af patienter med traumatiske hjerneskader.
</p>

<h2>1. Inicial Vurdering af Neurotraumapatient</h2>

<div class="algorithm-box">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 500" class="flowchart">
    <!-- Start -->
    <ellipse cx="300" cy="40" rx="80" ry="30" fill="#28a745" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2"/>
    <text x="300" y="45" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="white">PATIENT INDGÅR</text>

    <!-- Arrow -->
    <line x1="300" y1="70" x2="300" y2="110" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)"/>

    <!-- Check airway -->
    <rect x="200" y="110" width="200" height="60" fill="#0066cc" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2" rx="5"/>
    <text x="300" y="140" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="white">Sikre fri luftvej</text>
    <text x="300" y="160" text-anchor="middle" fill="white">Head Tilt, Chin Lift</text>

    <!-- Arrow -->
    <line x1="300" y1="170" x2="300" y2="210" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)"/>

    <!-- Check breathing -->
    <rect x="200" y="210" width="200" height="60" fill="#0066cc" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2" rx="5"/>
    <text x="300" y="240" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="white">Kontroller ventilation</text>
    <text x="300" y="260" text-anchor="middle" fill="white">SpO2 >95%, EtCO2 35-45</text>

    <!-- Arrow -->
    <line x1="300" y1="270" x2="300" y2="310" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)"/>

    <!-- Check GCS -->
    <rect x="200" y="310" width="200" height="60" fill="#0066cc" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2" rx="5"/>
    <text x="300" y="340" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="white">Vurder bevidsthed</text>
    <text x="300" y="360" text-anchor="middle" fill="white">GCS score</text>

    <!-- Split based on GCS -->
    <!-- Left: GCS <= 8 -->
    <line x1="200" y1="370" x2="100" y2="410" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)"/>
    <text x="120" y="395" font-weight="bold" fill="#dc3545">GCS ≤ 8</text>

    <rect x="20" y="410" width="160" height="70" fill="#dc3545" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2" rx="5"/>
    <text x="100" y="435" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="white">KRITISK</text>
    <text x="100" y="455" text-anchor="middle" fill="white">Intubation</text>
    <text x="100" y="470" text-anchor="middle" fill="white">CT hjerne</text>

    <!-- Right: GCS > 8 -->
    <line x1="400" y1="370" x2="500" y2="410" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrowhead)"/>
    <text x="460" y="395" font-weight="bold" fill="#ff9800">GCS > 8</text>

    <rect x="420" y="410" width="160" height="70" fill="#ff9800" stroke="#000" stroke-width="2" rx="5"/>
    <text x="500" y="435" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="bold" fill="white">MODERAT/MILD</text>
    <text x="500" y="455" text-anchor="middle" fill="white">Overvågning</text>
    <text x="500" y="470" text-anchor="middle" fill="white">Evt. CT</text>

    <!-- Arrow marker definition -->
    <defs>
      <marker id="arrowhead" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="9" refY="3" orient="auto">
        <polygon points="0 0, 10 3, 0 6" fill="#000"/>
      </marker>
    </defs>
  </svg>
</div>

<div class="algorithm-legend">
  <span class="legend-item" style="background: #28a745;">Start</span>
  <span class="legend-item" style="background: #0066cc;">Handling</span>
  <span class="legend-item" style="background: #dc3545;">Kritisk</span>
  <span class="legend-item" style="background: #ff9800;">Vigtig</span>
</div>

<h2>2. Visitation og Transport Algoritme</h2>

<div class="algorithm-box">
  <div class="decision-tree">
    <div class="tree-node root">
      <strong>Patient med hjerneskade</strong>
    </div>

    <div class="tree-branches">
      <div class="tree-branch">
        <div class="tree-condition">GCS ≤ 8 ELLER</div>
        <div class="tree-condition">Intrakranial blødning på CT ELLER</div>
        <div class="tree-condition">Midtlinieshifte > 5mm</div>
        <div class="tree-outcome critical">
          ⚕️ NIVEAU 1 - Neurokirurgisk center
          <div class="details">Akut transport, Neurokir. konsultation</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tree-branch">
        <div class="tree-condition">GCS 9-12 ELLER</div>
        <div class="tree-condition">Bevidstløshed efter skaden ELLER</div>
        <div class="tree-condition">Fokale neurologiske tegn</div>
        <div class="tree-outcome warning">
          ⚕️ NIVEAU 2 - Regional hospital
          <div class="details">Transport med overvågning, CT hjerne</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="tree-branch">
        <div class="tree-condition">GCS 15 UDEN symptomer ELLER</div>
        <div class="tree-condition">Lette symptomer, stabil</div>
        <div class="tree-outcome success">
          ⚕️ NIVEAU 3 - Lokal skadestue
          <div class="details">Evt. ambulant overvågning</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>3. Behandling af Intrakranielt Tryks (ICP)</h2>

<div class="algorithm-box">
  <div class="icp-protocol">
    <h3>ICP Håndtering Trin for Trin</h3>

    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">1</div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Primær håndtering:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Hoved i 30° højde</li>
          <li>Normal PaCO2 (35-45 mmHg)</li>
          <li>Normal temperatur</li>
          <li>Sedering og analgesi efter behov</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">2</div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Hvis ICP > 20 mmHg:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Mannitol 0.25-1 g/kg IV eller</li>
          <li>3% NaCl 5-10 mL/kg IV</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-number">3</div>
      <div class="step-content">
        <strong>Hvis fortsættende problemer:</strong>
        <ul>
          <li>Mild hyperventilation (målpCO2: 30-35 mmHg)</li>
          <li>Evt. barbituratindlæggelse</li>
          <li>Evt. dekompressionskraniotomi</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<h2>4. CT-Hjernescan Indikationer</h2>

<div class="algorithm-box">
  <table class="ct-indications">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Situation</th>
        <th>Indikation for CT</th>
        <th>Timing</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>GCS &lt; 15</strong></td>
        <td>AKUT CT hjerne</td>
        <td>Indenfor 1 time</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Mistanke fraktur</strong></td>
        <td>AKUT CT hjerne</td>
        <td>Indenfor 1 time</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Bevidstløshed</strong></td>
        <td>AKUT CT hjerne</td>
        <td>Indenfor 30 min</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Gentagende opkastning</strong></td>
        <td>AKUT CT hjerne</td>
        <td>Indenfor 2 timer</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Krampeanfald</strong></td>
        <td>AKUT CT hjerne</td>
        <td>Indenfor 1 time</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Blødning fra øre</strong></td>
        <td>AKUT CT hjerne</td>
        <td>Indenfor 1 time</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>Neurologisk forværring</strong></td>
        <td>AKUT CT hjerne</td>
        <td>ØJEBLIKKELIGT</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="alert alert-danger" style="margin-top: var(--space-2xl);">
  <div class="alert-title">🚨 Vigtige noter til algoritmer</div>
  <ul>
    <li>Algoritmer er vejledende - følg altid klinisk vurdering</li>
    <li>Ved tvivl, konsulter altid den relevante specialist</li>
    <li>Lokale procedurer kan afvige - følg dit hospitals protokoller</li>
    <li>Tidsangivelser er target-tider, ikke absolutte maksima</li>
  </ul>
</div>

